  "result": "If I could change the world in just one way, I'd make it so everyone could truly feel what it's like to be in someone else's shoes \u2014 at least for a moment.\n\nNot to erase disagreements or make us all think the same, but to make understanding automatic. If you could *really* feel what fear, joy, grief, or hope feels like for another person, I think cruelty would be a lot harder, and kindness would be a lot easier.\n\nThat one shift would ripple into everything else \u2014 how we handle conflict, how we take care of the planet, how we treat strangers, even how we talk to each other online. So much suffering comes from feeling unseen.\n\nWhat about you? What would *you* change?",
